+    ----------
+    X_group_scaled : ndarray of shape (n_samples, n_features)
+        Data that has already been standardized (centered and scaled).
+
+    feature_scales : ndarray of shape (n_features,)
+        Per-feature scale factors used during standardization.
+
+    Returns
+    -------
+    cov : ndarray of shape (n_features, n_features)
+        Covariance estimate in the original (non-standardized) space.
+    """
